        {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Runnable、Waiting、Review 和 Done 是这些事实的可见视图。UI 可以重排，truth 只能通过受控 transition 改写。", "size": 45, "gap": 18}
      ],
      "footer": "卡片是读模型，canonical state 才是事实源。",
      "filename": "03-multi-axis-state.jpg"
