        {"type": "label", "text": "03 / WHAT A MOVE EXECUTES", "size": 28, "gap": 22},
        {"type": "cards", "columns": 3, "size": 31, "items": [
          {"title": "Before", "text": "observe / authorize / precondition"},
          {"title": "During", "text": "execute / monitor / validate"},
          {"title": "After", "text": "writeback / receipt / successor"}
        ]},
        {"type": "rule", "text": "失败不会抹掉历史：replay / repair / replan", "size": 46, "gap": 16}
      ],
      "footer": "长程稳定来自可恢复状态，不来自一段无限增长的上下文。",
      "filename": "04-execution-cutaway.jpg"
